  "title": "Geekrown",
  "description": "Six candidates are vying for the throne of Nation A—but one is a traitor. This spy from Nation B must be found, or else Nation A will be taken over entirely. To protect her homeland’s future, the princess has tasked Kai Blackman, one of the candidates, with tracking down the spy. The only problem: He’s a frail, scrawny anime nerd with zero combat ability whatsoever. He does have on special skill, though: he can see through people's lies! Can this utter geek survive in this intrigue-laden battle for the throne?! It’s a riveting military fantasy from Shinobu Ohtaka, author of Orient and Magi! Translation by Kevin Gifford, Lettering by Darren Smith, Editing by Thalia Sutton, KPS Products Corp./YKS Services LLC",
